<h2>Image sizes and alignment</h2>

<p>
  Classes: <c>.small</c>, default, <c>.large</c>; <c>.left</c>, <c>.right</c>. Or set <c>width=</c> / <c>height=</c> yourself.
</p>

<img src=diagram.svg alt=small class=small height=70px />

<img src=diagram.svg alt=left class=left height=70px />

<img src=diagram.svg alt=right class=right height=70px />

<img src=diagram.svg alt="centered, bigger" height=110px />

<notes>
  Each image is its own block: they fade in together, or one after another with stagger.
</notes>
